# Aquila Change: knowledge path side 3, Mawed Crucible

knowledge-path-side-s3-crucible-name = Mawed Crucible
knowledge-path-side-s3-crucible-desc =
    Pain stares back at me. I could not summon the figure of the Aristocrat, but the Priest pointed me at a different recipe.

    Allows you to transmute a portable water tank and a table to create a Mawed Crucible.
    The Mawed Crucible brews potent potions for combat and daily use, but between brews it must be fed body parts and organs.
    Its mass replenishes on its own, yet brewing requires a full supply.

ent-MawedCrucible = mawed crucible
    .desc = A yawning maw of bone and flesh that loudly chews on whatever is offered to it.

ent-MawedCrucibleBrewSoul = brew of the crucible soul
    .desc = A murky liquid with someone else's face floating in it. For forty seconds walls do not exist for you, and then the crucible calls you back.

ent-MawedCrucibleBrewDusk = brew of dusk and dawn
    .desc = A sky in a vial that cannot decide whether it is evening or morning. For ninety seconds nothing can hide from your eyes.

ent-MawedCrucibleBrewWounded = brew of the wounded soldier
    .desc = A bitter drink that tastes of iron and bandages. For a minute wounds close on their own, and pain no longer slows your step.

heretic-ritual-crucible = Mawed Crucible
heretic-ritual-crucible-desc =
    A portable water tank and a table. The crucible will figure out the rest.

mawed-crucible-full = The crucible is already full and wants nothing more.
mawed-crucible-empty = The crucible is empty and cannot brew.
mawed-crucible-not-full = The crucible has not gathered its full mass yet.
mawed-crucible-fed = The crucible crunches down on {$item}.
mawed-crucible-vital = The crucible spits out a vital organ.
mawed-crucible-bite = The crucible bites your hand!
mawed-crucible-anchor-on = The crucible digs into the floor.
mawed-crucible-anchor-off = The crucible tears itself off the floor.
mawed-crucible-anchor-fail = The crucible has nothing to bite into.
mawed-crucible-brew-verb = Brew {$brew}
mawed-crucible-brewed = The crucible spits out {$brew}.
mawed-crucible-solution-full = The crucible's solution is already full.
mawed-crucible-flask-empty = The flask has no eldritch essence left.
mawed-crucible-flask-filled = The crucible greedily soaks up the eldritch essence.
mawed-crucible-brew-drunk = You drink {$brew}.
mawed-crucible-brew-reject = The brew scalds the throat of one who does not serve the Mansus.
mawed-crucible-brew-cooldown = You have not yet recovered from your last walk through the walls.
